                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14321095" author="julienledem" created="Sat, 14 Feb 2015 01:11:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Argh.&lt;br/&gt;
Preconditions.checkArgument should be replaced with an if to avoid generating the string when there is no error.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14321103" author="rdblue" created="Sat, 14 Feb 2015 01:18:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;What about updating Preconditions to take an &lt;tt&gt;Object...&lt;/tt&gt; argument and use &lt;tt&gt;String.format&lt;/tt&gt;? That way we don&apos;t have to wrap all preconditions in an if for the same expression they check. See &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/kite-sdk/kite/blob/master/kite-data/kite-data-core/src/main/java/org/kitesdk/data/ValidationException.java#L49&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;ValidationException.check&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for an example.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14324794" author="julienledem" created="Tue, 17 Feb 2015 20:11:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This would still incur the cost of wrapping the parameters into an Array of Objects (ints into Integers and then array).&lt;br/&gt;
It could be negligible but we should verify this.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14347881" author="rdblue" created="Thu, 5 Mar 2015 01:14:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I just did a quick test for the overhead. I ran 10,000,000 iterations and observed the time using &lt;tt&gt;System.nanoTime()&lt;/tt&gt; to record start and end times:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;With varargs, no args: 3868817 nanos&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;With varargs, 2 args: 5954869 nanos&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Without varargs: 3745177 nanos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Re-running each seemed to produce approximately the same values. While it is slower, it isn&apos;t an order of magnitude slower and is significantly faster than string operations.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14347892" author="rdblue" created="Thu, 5 Mar 2015 01:20:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-parquet-mr/pull/133&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;PR #133&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14347946" author="rdblue" created="Thu, 5 Mar 2015 01:57:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Issue resolved by pull request 133&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-parquet-mr/pull/133&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-parquet-mr/pull/133&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17857149" author="rok" created="Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:27:11 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue has been migrated to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-java/issues/1733&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;issue #1733&lt;/a&gt; on GitHub. Please see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2502&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;migration documentation&lt;/a&gt; for further details.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
